            {
                "entry_id": "f9a75d0e-3c92-3c13-88e4-d15cce67cbab",
                "word": "sled",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2d927a30-7f92-4b5c-a545-5f9e2f315a66",
                        "entry_id": "f9a75d0e-3c92-3c13-88e4-d15cce67cbab",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "sleds"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "40d6cae1-3a4c-35b3-85d2-0bd828d4e863",
                        "entry_id": "f9a75d0e-3c92-3c13-88e4-d15cce67cbab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A small, light vehicle with runners, used recreationally, mostly by children, for sliding down snow-covered hills; no draft animal pulls it."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "871a9d0d-fb8f-4c7f-89a5-5b3a9d25cbf5",
                                "sense_id": "40d6cae1-3a4c-35b3-85d2-0bd828d4e863",
                                "text": "The child zoomed down the hill on his sled."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "53152dcd-a9dc-318e-8dd6-aeb2649d8e00",
                        "entry_id": "f9a75d0e-3c92-3c13-88e4-d15cce67cbab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A vehicle on runners, used for conveying loads over the snow or ice, and often pulled by sled dogs."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Canada",
                            "US"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "40e324ec-c8f3-41e8-a7ad-42f118120af3",
                                "sense_id": "53152dcd-a9dc-318e-8dd6-aeb2649d8e00",
                                "text": "\"Mush!\" he yelled at the dogs pulling the sled."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "58c2614f-afac-331c-956f-d8218e76add1",
                        "entry_id": "f9a75d0e-3c92-3c13-88e4-d15cce67cbab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A snowmobile."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Canada",
                            "US",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6a49e09-489a-4f1c-a0e4-88319e830eae",
                                "sense_id": "58c2614f-afac-331c-956f-d8218e76add1",
                                "text": "We saw them go by on their sleds this afternoon, headed toward their grandfather's quarter section."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2f52dea9-e76c-3061-ad8c-12c4c375e0c9",
                        "entry_id": "f9a75d0e-3c92-3c13-88e4-d15cce67cbab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A car (automobile) or truck, usually called so with the implication of sledlike traits: heavy, low-slung, and prone to going fast but not braking or cornering particularly well."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Canada",
                            "US",
                            "figuratively",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fbcf7f99-648d-4af3-a1dc-efb9be5b767d",
                                "sense_id": "2f52dea9-e76c-3061-ad8c-12c4c375e0c9",
                                "text": "Near-synonyms: land yacht, boat"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "81ea4865-902d-4c16-98a7-1f98c6775d4f",
                                "sense_id": "2f52dea9-e76c-3061-ad8c-12c4c375e0c9",
                                "text": "He was a bit reckless and frankly we were nervous about riding with him in that big old sled of his, a Cadillac with a V-8."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7dccf8c-3db1-4a3a-a601-89ebca91ab8e",
                                "sense_id": "2f52dea9-e76c-3061-ad8c-12c4c375e0c9",
                                "text": "That sled had manual drum brakes on all four corners."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
